  "body": "## Breaking Changes \r\n*none*\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n*none*\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n* Repeating startup banner by @g-despot in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12912\r\n* chore(dynamic-shard): convert log to warn instead of info by @moogacs in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12974\r\n* fix(replica): bounds-check read repair, guard group-by objects bucket by @moogacs in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12876\r\n* perf(db): skip the startup shard-size sweep when lazy loading is set explicitly by @moogacs in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12979\r\n* perf(contains-pr11): fold a batched Contains filter across workers by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12901\r\n* fix(reindex): rename a rebuilt index into place only once the schema lists it by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12949\r\n* fix(raft-cluster): barrier a new leader's FSM before it judges proposes by @moogacs in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12915\r\n* fix(nodes): authz logic on `v1/nodes?output=minimal` when caller has `verbose` perms by @tsmith023 in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12981\r\n* feat: node-level query admission control (P1b) by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12078\r\n* fix(reindex): enable-rangeable becomes a semantic migration by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12700\r\n* Add Weaviate license and license switch by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12796\r\n* Pre-compile regexp for role validation by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13003\r\n* fix(queue): create chunk files with O_EXCL to prevent same-microsecond name collision by @abdelr in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12880\r\n* fix(backup): missed include wildcards are a no-op for users/roles, an error for classes by @tsmith023 in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13027\r\n* fix(hnsw): preserve isolated nodes during compaction by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13033\r\n* fix(hfresh): recover orphaned postings through reassign-all by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13035\r\n* fix(lsmkv): remove symlink tracing when listing backup files by @tsmith023 in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13032\r\n* feat(debug): make shard optional for HFresh reassignment by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13043\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/compare/v1.39.3...v1.39.4",
